This PR adds support for loading custom transformers models with NamedParameters.

This is generally helpful for models which have something of the form

```
class Model(nn.Module):
  def __init__(self):
    self.my_scalar_hyperparam = nn.Parameter([0])

  def forward(self, x):
    x = x * self.my_scalar_hyperparam
```

This is a fixed version of #18034 . My previous code overwrote all model attributes, but we should only be overwriting the defaults - I had accidentally also overwrote the `'architectures'` attribute that was set a couple lines earlier.

